            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-24999",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-24999: OWASP Top Ten 2017 Category A9 - Using Components with Known Vulnerabilities"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-24999?s=gitlab&n=express&t=npm&vr=%3C4.17.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "qs before 6.10.3, as used in Express before 4.17.3 and other products, allows attackers to cause a Node process hang for an Express application because an __ proto__ key can be used. In many typical Express use cases, an unauthenticated remote attacker can place the attack payload in the query string of the URL that is used to visit the application, such as a[__proto__]=b&a[__proto__]&a[length]=100000000. The fix was backported to qs 6.9.7, 6.8.3, 6.7.3, 6.6.1, 6.5.3, 6.4.1, 6.3.3, and 6.2.4 (and therefore Express 4.17.3, which has \"deps: qs@6.9.7\" in its release description, is not vulnerable).\n",
                "markdown": "> qs before 6.10.3, as used in Express before 4.17.3 and other products, allows attackers to cause a Node process hang for an Express application because an __ proto__ key can be used. In many typical Express use cases, an unauthenticated remote attacker can place the attack payload in the query string of the URL that is used to visit the application, such as a[__proto__]=b&a[__proto__]&a[length]=100000000. The fix was backported to qs 6.9.7, 6.8.3, 6.7.3, 6.6.1, 6.5.3, 6.4.1, 6.3.3, and 6.2.4 (and therefore Express 4.17.3, which has \"deps: qs@6.9.7\" in its release description, is not vulnerable).\n\n|                                                                                                       |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:npm/express@4.17.1  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <4.17.3                 |\n|Fixed version                                                                  4.17.3                  |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H]]                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">=6.7.0,<6.7.3",
                "cvssV3": 7.5,
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H",
                "fixed_version": "6.7.3",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:npm/express@4.17.1",
                  "pkg:npm/qs@6.7.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5",
                "tags": [
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            },
